			"Message": "refactor(Maintain): Remove wildcard re-exports and use explicit module paths\n\nRemove the `pub use` wildcard re-exports from the Rhai module (ConfigLoader, ScriptRunner, EnvironmentResolver) to enforce explicit module paths throughout the codebase. Update CLI modules to import directly from `ConfigLoader` instead of the re-exported items.\n\nAdditionally, update function calls from snake_case to PascalCase to align with CodeEditorLand naming conventions (e.g., `ScriptRunner::execute_profile_script` → `ScriptRunner::ExecuteProfileScript`). Add missing fields (`workbench_type`, `features`) to test contexts to match the updated ConfigLoader API.\n\nThis refactoring improves code clarity by making dependencies explicit and ensures consistent PascalCase naming throughout the Maintain element.",
			"SHA": "ca7ac5623e9f3239836ff4371274666c58313a26"
